HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4924ef93, "the arity is wrong, or this name is not typed here");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6e4cf1fe, "the arity is wrong");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_39d36a46, "` cannot fail, so there is no error case to handle \342\200\224 this is the shape `to_str` and `to_f64` hand back, because neither of those can fail either");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7b89c625, "remove the `.");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_69a7ba57, "nothing to find");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_9b3d27f, "the needle never occurs");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1ac9ad26, "` cannot cross the FFI boundary, and it is ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_9821570, " \342\200\224 a C header can declare a number, `bool`, `str`, `ptr`, `cstr`, a function type as a parameter, and a `record` declared in this same group (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_43ea7c8, " \342\200\224 the callback may stand there, but `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_60e81b15, "` inside it cannot (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_687018f9, "a callback's parameters and result follow the same rule as any other extern type (spec, \302\247 FFI), so `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_df5e538, "` is refused inside one for the reason it is refused outside one: a C header cannot declare it, and a value C holds is a value this compiler stopped tracking");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6ba0c278, "where C has to see the elements, hand it what C already understands \342\200\224 a `ptr` and a length, or one scalar at a time \342\200\224 and keep the container on the Heroes side of the call");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5b78a1a1, "` cannot return `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_281d2760, "` \342\200\224 a function type crosses the FFI boundary as a *parameter* only (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_2b5b4e75, "the address a Heroes program passes OUT is one this compiler emitted, so C calls a body this compiler type-checked. An address C hands BACK is a body nothing here has seen, and calling it through a Heroes call site would convert the arguments and hold the result the way this language does, against a signature no probe compared to the header");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4dbdab47, "declare the result `ptr` if the program only stores it and hands it back to C");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_45b2cf08, "an `extern constant` cannot be declared `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_21bd6f33, "` \342\200\224 ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_c83d1d8, "` cannot be declared `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5262c4ba, "` cannot be a field of a `record` in an `extern` group \342\200\224 the header owns the layout, and it can hold a number, `bool`, `ptr`, `cstr`, or another record of the group (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_f9e59c9, " \342\200\224 reached through `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4aee1764, "` is `partial`, so it cannot be ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_21ed0452, ": the fields it does not name are part of the answer, and this program cannot see them");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_67527eeb, "a `partial` record may be read, copied, passed to C and returned from it \342\200\224 what it gives up is `==`, `hash` and being a map key. Name every field of the header's struct to get them back, and drop `partial` from `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_60c5df57, "fixed_array_length");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_56de503c, "` holds exactly ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_619e9968, ", and this literal has ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_55164f16, " \342\200\224 a fixed array's length is part of its type, so the two must agree (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_38d22bc2, "fixed_index_out_of_range");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_370423da, "` holds ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_15140826, ", so its last index is ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_2c6443e5, ", and this is ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4e1db6ad, " \342\200\224 a fixed array's length is part of its type, so the index is checked here rather than at run time");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_71096103, "` is a C array member, so it belongs to a `record` inside an `extern` group \342\200\224 this record's layout is this language's, and a fixed array exists to match one a C compiler chose (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7375ef2e, "use `[T]` here: it grows, it is compared and hashed like any other value, and it is what every Heroes record holds");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_70b7a00d, "it is a float");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_553eda56, "` is a float");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6050c8cd, "` cannot be a map key, because ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3ecfb97f, "a `nan` is not equal to itself, so it can be stored and never found again. Key the map on something exact \342\200\224 an `i64` of the value scaled to the precision you need, or a `str` \342\200\224 and keep the float in the value. Reached through a type parameter this cannot be checked, and the runtime aborts instead");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_37, "7");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5216f75b, "cstr_escapes");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_2b9d4a87, "`.cstr()` lends this string to C for the length of one call (\302\2474.19), and a lend may stand only as an argument of a call \342\200\224 here it stands somewhere the pointer outlives the bytes it points into");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1ee20535, "pass it directly as an argument of the call that reads it. The bytes belong to the `str`, and the slot holding one is released when its function returns OR when the same expression runs again, whichever comes first \342\200\224 so a lend kept past its call is reading freed memory by the next iteration. A wrapper that reaches C from another module takes a `str` and lends inside itself");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_730ccfaa, "cstr_out_of_heroes");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7ab4d146, "` answers `cstr`, and a `cstr` is C's pointer rather than this language's string (\302\2474.19) \342\200\224 only a function inside an `extern` group may answer one");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3836c972, "answer `str` and let the caller lend it with `.cstr()` at the call that reads it. A `cstr` handed out of a Heroes function points into bytes this function stops owning when it returns");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5a834eb3, "cstr_in_a_record");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_28a2e793, "` holds a `cstr`, and `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_34a1df30, "` is not a record of an `extern` group \342\200\224 a C pointer parked in a Heroes record outlives the bytes it points into (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_28d8764f, "hold a `str` in the field and lend it with `.cstr()` at the call that reads it. A group's `record` may hold a `cstr`, because there the fields are the header's and C owns the bytes");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4a09d1b8, "lease_escapes");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5e8ac22d, "` is a lease \342\200\224 a copy of the bytes that C may read until `end_lease(@");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_fa9ada4, ")` \342\200\224 and its name may stand only as an argument of a call; here it is copied, and the copy would outlive the release");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_401a2956, "pass `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_20c5db15, "` directly to the call that reads it. The release nulls this one cell, so a pointer that lives anywhere else keeps pointing at freed bytes");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6ef43575, "lease_written");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_d1bbcb8, "` is a lease, and the only write a lease cell takes after its declaration is `end_lease(@");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_a9f17e9, ")` \342\200\224 a value stored over it would leak the bytes it held, or free bytes nobody leased");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5d4cdc84, "declare a second cell for the second lease. One cell, one `.lease()`, one `end_lease`");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_40ffd478, "end_lease_of_no_lease");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_15703dd3, "`end_lease` frees what `.lease()` made, and it takes the cell that holds it: `end_lease(@x)` where `x: cstr @ s.lease()` \342\200\224 this argument is not such a cell");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3a3f4171, "a lend (`.cstr()`), a pointer from C and a literal are freed by whoever owns them, and this program does not; a lease copied into another cell cannot be released from there, because the release must null the one cell the pointer lives in");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_51548ce4, "hole_not_renderable");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_39886952, "a hole in an `f\"\342\200\246\"` literal writes its value as `to_str` does, and `to_str` takes an integer, a float, `bool` or `str` \342\200\224 this one holds a `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_64bf7bae, "`, which has no text");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_53ad2f2, "write the part of it that is text: a field, `.len()`, `.must()` on a `T?` you have checked, or a `to_str()` call of your own. A record, an array or a map has no rendering in this language today");
